# Local environment. NOTE: .env itself stays tracked — Lovable's build reads it,
# and it holds only publishable (browser-visible) Supabase values. Real secrets
# such as SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY live in the platform environment, never here.
.env.local
.env.*.local
